WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:04.462
I think that Fraggle Rock was different in its day because

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:06.631
it was this giant puppet extravaganza.

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:12.887
Fraggle Rock is a timeless piece and when you watch it today it still feels pretty relevant. 

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:16.725
We all bought into the premise and it became a life-altering experience. 

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:19.686
It has remained something that we're proud of after all these years.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:23.273
It was always in the house. We had BetaMax tapes with Fraggle Rock on it. 

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:25.358
It's...it's magic. Absolute magic. 

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:29.821
There's just something kind of transporting about the spirit of the show. 

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:32.782
I just remember the feel of the music. It was so funky.

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:35.952
It was funny. The characters were authentic to who they were. 

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:38.621
It was cool and different, and it's really, really special. 

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:43.418
I had this like, instantaneous feeling of I have to do that. I want to be part of that. 

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:48.214
Are we ready!?

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:53.386
The original Fraggle Rock is the beating heart of this series.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:58.266
This is not a complete reinvention. It's still very faithful to the original. 

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:00.268
We knew we wanted to keep the Fraggles. We knew we wanted to keep the

00:01:00.268 --> 00:01:05.106
Doozers, and the Gorgs, and Doc and Sprocket...But give it a 21st century update.

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:08.193
If you go right up close, it's a lot like the original show.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:11.821
And if you pull back, it just gets bigger and bigger and bigger.

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:14.783
Seeing how huge it is took my breath away.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:21.247
The scripts are so funny. Not just funny for kids. They are genuinely funny.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:25.210
Your mind is going to be [mimics explosion] impressed.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:30.757
It brings a warmth and a kindness and a sort of sense of belonging.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:34.010
We have an amazing team working on this series of Fraggle Rock.

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:36.554
I am honored to be back helping continue the magic.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.349
We pulled out all the puppet stops on Fraggle Rock.

00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:42.018
There's so much mechanical creativity on this show.

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:43.061
It's Magic!

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:45.980
This is the control which I operate with my thumb.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:51.027
I have never heard of such a...what! I have one, too!...Wow!

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:54.864
The creature shop built a new and improved Junior Gorg......Yeah!

00:01:54.864 --> 00:01:57.742
His face is just so much more expressive now.

00:01:57.742 --> 00:02:00.328
So you can get all kinds of really great movement out of it.

00:02:01.329 --> 00:02:04.833
Heh! You thought I was asleep. Hehe. I'm a good actor. Hehehe!

00:02:05.542 --> 00:02:07.127
Doozers were always the most fun.

00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:10.255
The Doozers in this version of Fraggle Rock are technologically advanced.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:13.174
We're able to 3D print all their accessories.

00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:15.260
Doozer technology is limitless.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.469
We have a Doozer jetpack.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.304
Woah!

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:21.099
Welcome to the 21st century!

00:02:21.099 --> 00:02:23.393
Music is a huge part of Fraggle Rock.

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:26.020
And the original songs were just amazing

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:29.315
I don't know if I can share this, but we're even re-using some of the classic songs.

00:02:29.315 --> 00:02:32.485
Harvey Mason Jr. has just taken that music and completely reimagined it,

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:35.196
but it still feels really familiar and really accessible.

00:02:35.196 --> 00:02:36.406
Yeah!

00:02:36.406 --> 00:02:39.784
The new songs fit right in line with the legacy songs,

00:02:39.784 --> 00:02:41.286
so I think you get the best of both worlds.

00:02:41.286 --> 00:02:43.246
The music is so, so good.

00:02:43.246 --> 00:02:47.333
I find myself singing them all the time around the house. I can't get them out of my head.

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:49.460
This is nothing short of a dream come true.

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:53.756
This whole situation is kind of surreal to me.

00:02:53.756 --> 00:02:54.841
After you! Oh!

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:57.468
Taking silliness very seriously.

00:02:58.011 --> 00:03:04.767
John Tartaglia is so deeply invested in writing, producing, he's performing. 

00:03:04.767 --> 00:03:07.103
He knows everything about Fraggle Rock.

00:03:07.103 --> 00:03:10.148
It was like having a historian in the writers room with us.

00:03:10.148 --> 00:03:11.941
So wise. You're so wise.

00:03:11.941 --> 00:03:15.945
I need a steaming hot cup of radish juice. It's been a day. Woof!

00:03:18.823 --> 00:03:22.035
Working on the original Fraggle Rock was so special I thought I

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:28.208
would never experience it again. But I'm experiencing it here so much. I'm so thrilled.

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:33.129
Being able to acknowledge the legacy that came before us

00:03:33.129 --> 00:03:37.050
and contribute to the future legacy is pretty monumental.

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:40.845
Fraggle Rock was kinda bold and fearless.

00:03:41.137 --> 00:03:44.057
It touched on some pretty heavy things some times,

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:46.351
and we're not shying away from those at all. 

00:03:46.809 --> 00:03:49.604
That's one way that I think we're honoring Jim's vision.

00:03:49.854 --> 00:03:54.234
There is a spirit about Fraggle Rock that does constantly remind me of my father

00:03:54.234 --> 00:04:01.449
which is this sort of buoyant optimism that reflects the way that my father thought and his

00:04:01.449 --> 00:04:04.869
philosophy which was 'there are serious things the world, 

00:04:04.869 --> 00:04:08.915
but you have the power to add love into the world.'

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:09.958
Woohoo!

00:04:09.958 --> 00:04:12.335
The world needs Fraggles.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:13.628
I knew it!

00:04:13.628 --> 00:04:15.296
We need Fraggle Rock.

00:04:15.296 --> 00:04:17.757
The world has changed since the original series.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:21.177
I would say that we need Fraggle Rock more now than when we first made it.

00:04:21.344 --> 00:04:22.345
That's my cue.

00:04:22.887 --> 00:04:26.808
It is about understanding, and I think that is really the importance. 

00:04:26.808 --> 00:04:27.934
You're not alone.

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:31.521
I think audiences are gonna be pretty blown away by how to world looks,

00:04:31.521 --> 00:04:34.732
how funny the characters are, how much they love each other,

00:04:34.732 --> 00:04:36.359
and how much fun that is to watch.

00:04:36.359 --> 00:04:40.113
There's really nothing like this on TV so I'm really excited that it was coming back.

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:42.198
We have so many surprises. Mmhmm.

00:04:42.198 --> 00:04:43.783
Songs! Games!

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:48.246
My hope is that the fans will be transported back to their childhoods,

00:04:48.246 --> 00:04:51.833
and kids that are sitting feel that it's possible to have a hole

00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:53.918
in your wall that goes down to Fraggle Rock.

